<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AI Landslide Digital Twin — North Eastern India</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.css" />
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');

:root{
  --bg: #0C1310;
  --bg-panel: #121C17;
  --bg-panel-2: #16211B;
  --bg-raised: #1B2721;
  --line: #253630;
  --line-soft: #1C2822;
  --text: #E9EFE9;
  --text-muted: #93A69B;
  --text-dim: #5E7268;
  --water: #4FA3B8;
  --road: #C7B37E;
  --risk-verylow: #3A8F5E;
  --risk-low: #6BAE6E;
  --risk-moderate: #D6A83B;
  --risk-high: #E0812F;
  --risk-critical: #C23A2E;
  --focus: #7CC6A6;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
body{ background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-family:'Space Grotesk','Segoe UI',sans-serif; min-height:100vh; }
.mono{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; }
button{ font-family:inherit; }
::selection{ background:var(--focus); color:#0C1310; }
:focus-visible{ outline:2px solid var(--focus); outline-offset:2px; }

.app{ max-width:1400px; margin:0 auto; padding:20px 20px 50px; }

.header{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:20px; flex-wrap:wrap; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:16px; margin-bottom:18px; }
.header-left h1{ font-size:24px; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 4px; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
.header-left .sub{ color:var(--text-muted); font-size:13.5px; margin:0; }
.header-left .sim-note{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-top:9px; padding:5px 10px; background:var(--bg-panel-2); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:5px; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-dim); max-width:640px; line-height:1.5; }
.header-left .sim-note .dot{ width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--water); flex:none; margin-top:5px; }
.status-pill{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:6px; }
.status-badge{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; padding:9px 15px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--bg-panel-2); font-size:13px; font-weight:500; }
.status-badge .led{ width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%; box-shadow:0 0 8px currentColor; background:currentColor; }
.status-badge.normal{ color:var(--risk-verylow); }
.status-badge.watch{ color:var(--risk-moderate); }
.status-badge.warning{ color:var(--risk-high); }
.status-badge.critical{ color:var(--risk-critical); }
.status-caption{ font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); }

.layout{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:230px minmax(0,1fr) 320px; gap:16px; align-items:start; }
@media (max-width:1100px){ .layout{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

.panel{ background:var(--bg-panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:15px; }
.panel + .panel{ margin-top:16px; }
.panel h2{ font-size:11.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--text-dim); font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; }

.field{ margin-bottom:15px; }
.field label{ display:block; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:6px; }
select{ width:100%; background:var(--bg-raised); color:var(--text); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:5px; padding:8px 9px; font-size:12.5px; font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer; }
.rain-readout{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; margin-bottom:4px; }
.rain-readout .val{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; font-size:19px; font-weight:600; color:var(--water); }
.rain-readout .unit{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-dim); }
input[type=range]{ width:100%; accent-color:var(--water); cursor:pointer; height:4px; margin:8px 0 4px; }
.range-scale{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:10px; color:var(--text-dim); }
.reset-btn,.layer-btn{ width:100%; background:none; border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--text-muted); border-radius:5px; padding:8px; font-size:12px; cursor:pointer; margin-top:4px; }
.reset-btn:hover,.layer-btn:hover{ border-color:var(--text-muted); color:var(--text); }
.layer-toggle{ display:flex; gap:6px; }
.layer-toggle button{ flex:1; background:var(--bg-raised); border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--text-muted); border-radius:5px; padding:7px 4px; font-size:11px; cursor:pointer; }
.layer-toggle button.active{ border-color:var(--water); color:var(--water); background:var(--bg-panel-2); }

.legend-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:12px; padding:3px 0; color:var(--text-muted); }
.legend-swatch{ width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; flex:none; border:1px solid #0C1310; }
.icon-legend{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px; margin-top:9px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft); }
.icon-legend .row{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-dim); }

.map-toolbar{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:9px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
.map-toolbar .zone-name{ font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600; }
.map-toolbar .zone-coords{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); }
.map-wrap{ background:var(--bg-panel-2); border:1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius:6px; padding:8px; position:relative; }
#leafletMap{ width:100%; height:520px; border-radius:4px; background:#0C1310; }
.map-hint{ margin-top:8px; font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); }

.cell-strip{ display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:12px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft); }
.cell-strip .stat{ min-width:82px; }
.cell-strip .stat .k{ font-size:10px; color:var(--text-dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; }
.cell-strip .stat .v{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; font-size:14.5px; margin-top:2px; }

.score-card{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:15px; }
.score-ring{ position:relative; width:78px; height:78px; flex:none; }
.score-ring svg{ width:100%; height:100%; transform:rotate(-90deg); }
.score-ring .center{ position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column; }
.score-ring .num{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; font-size:21px; font-weight:600; }
.score-ring .of100{ font-size:9px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:-2px; }
.score-meta .cat{ font-size:15px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:3px; }
.score-meta .prob{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-muted); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; }
.score-meta .loc{ font-size:10.5px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:6px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; }

.explain-sentence{ font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.5; color:var(--text-muted); background:var(--bg-panel-2); border-left:2px solid var(--water); padding:10px 12px; border-radius:0 5px 5px 0; margin:12px 0 13px; }
.contrib-row{ margin-bottom:9px; }
.contrib-label{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:11.5px; margin-bottom:3px; }
.contrib-label .name{ color:var(--text-muted); }
.contrib-label .pct{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; color:var(--text-dim); }
.contrib-bar-bg{ height:6px; background:var(--bg-raised); border-radius:3px; overflow:hidden; }
.contrib-bar-fill{ height:100%; border-radius:3px; }

.infra-summary{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:10px; line-height:1.5; }
.infra-list{ list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:7px; }
.infra-list li{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-size:12px; padding:7px 9px; background:var(--bg-panel-2); border-radius:5px; border:1px solid var(--line-soft); }
.infra-list li .tag{ font-size:9.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; color:var(--text-dim); }

.hist-card{ background:var(--bg-panel-2); border:1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius:6px; padding:11px 12px; }
.hist-card .sim{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; margin-bottom:6px; }
.hist-card .sim .pct{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; font-size:17px; font-weight:600; color:var(--water); }
.hist-card .sim .label{ font-size:10.5px; color:var(--text-dim); }
.hist-card .desc{ font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.5; }
.hist-card .desc b{ color:var(--text); font-weight:600; }

.route-panel{ margin-top:16px; }
.route-controls{ display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:14px; }
.route-controls .find-btn{ background:var(--water); color:#08151A; border:none; border-radius:6px; padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; }
.route-controls .find-btn:hover{ filter:brightness(1.08); }
.route-controls .find-btn:disabled{ opacity:.4; cursor:not-allowed; }
.checkbox-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted); }
.checkbox-row input{ accent-color:var(--risk-critical); }
.route-results{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr)); gap:12px; }
.route-stat{ background:var(--bg-panel-2); border:1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius:6px; padding:10px 12px; }
.route-stat .k{ font-size:10px; color:var(--text-dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; }
.route-stat .v{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; font-size:15px; margin-top:3px; }
.route-empty{ font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); }

.footer-note{ margin-top:22px; font-size:11px; color:var(--text-dim); line-height:1.6; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:13px; }

.contact-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; padding:7px 9px; background:var(--bg-panel-2); border-radius:5px; border:1px solid var(--line-soft); margin-bottom:6px; font-size:12px; }
.contact-row .lbl{ color:var(--text-muted); }
.contact-row .unverified{ font-size:9.5px; color:var(--risk-moderate); display:block; margin-top:2px; }
.contact-row a{ color:var(--water); white-space:nowrap; text-decoration:none; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; }
.contact-row a:hover{ text-decoration:underline; }
.state-contact-heading{ font-size:10.5px; color:var(--text-dim); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; margin:10px 0 6px; }

.alert-banner{ padding:10px 12px; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(194,58,46,0.12); border:1px solid var(--risk-critical); font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:4px; }
.alert-banner .title{ font-weight:600; color:var(--risk-critical); margin-bottom:3px; }
.alert-log-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:10px; padding:8px 10px; background:var(--bg-panel-2); border-radius:5px; border:1px solid var(--line-soft); margin-bottom:6px; font-size:12px; }
.alert-log-row .meta{ color:var(--text-dim); font-size:10.5px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; }

.leaflet-popup-content-wrapper{ background:var(--bg-panel-2); color:var(--text); border-radius:6px; }
.leaflet-popup-tip{ background:var(--bg-panel-2); }
.leaflet-container{ font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; }
.pin-label{ font-family:'IBM Plex Mono'; font-size:10px; color:#F4F1E6; text-shadow:0 0 3px #000,0 0 3px #000; white-space:nowrap; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">

  <header class="header">
    <div class="header-left">
      <h1>AI Landslide Digital Twin — North Eastern Region</h1>
      <p class="sub">Risk monitoring &amp; evacuation decision support across landslide-prone hill districts of NE India · SIH26001</p>
      <div class="sim-note"><span class="dot"></span><span>Basemap is real satellite imagery (Esri World Imagery) and evacuation routes are computed on the real road network (OSRM). Per-site <b>risk scores</b> are a simplified illustrative model, not a live operational feed — calibrate against IMD / SDMA / GSI / NRSC data before real deployment.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="status-pill">
      <div class="status-badge" id="statusBadge"><span class="led"></span><span id="statusText">Normal</span></div>
      <div class="status-caption" id="statusCaption">Region-wide early-warning status</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="layout">
    <div class="col-left">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Monitored site</h2>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="stateSelect">State</label>
          <select id="stateSelect"></select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="siteSelect">Hotspot / district town</label>
          <select id="siteSelect"></select>
        </div>
        <div class="field" style="margin-bottom:4px;">
          <div class="rain-readout"><span class="unit">24h rainfall (what-if)</span><span><span class="val" id="rainVal">120</span><span class="unit"> mm</span></span></div>
          <input type="range" id="rainSlider" min="20" max="400" step="5" value="120">
          <div class="range-scale"><span>20mm</span><span>400mm</span></div>
        </div>
        <button class="reset-btn" id="resetBtn">Reset to baseline (60 mm)</button>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Basemap</h2>
        <div class="layer-toggle">
          <button id="btnSat" class="active">Satellite</button>
          <button id="btnDark">Dark map</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Risk legend</h2>
        <div class="legend-row"><span class="legend-swatch" style="background:var(--risk-verylow)"></span>Very low (0–20)</div>
        <div class="legend-row"><span class="legend-swatch" style="background:var(--risk-low)"></span>Low (20–40)</div>
        <div class="legend-row"><span class="legend-swatch" style="background:var(--risk-moderate)"></span>Moderate (40–60)</div>
        <div class="legend-row"><span class="legend-swatch" style="background:var(--risk-high)"></span>High (60–80)</div>
        <div class="legend-row"><span class="legend-swatch" style="background:var(--risk-critical)"></span>Critical (80–100)</div>
        <div class="icon-legend">
          <div class="row">★ Shelter / relief centre</div>
          <div class="row">● Monitored hotspot</div>
          <div class="row">┅ Computed evacuation route (real roads)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-center">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="map-toolbar">
          <div><div class="zone-name" id="zoneName">—</div><div class="zone-coords" id="zoneCoords">—</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="map-wrap"><div id="leafletMap"></div></div>
        <div class="map-hint">Click any coloured marker to inspect its risk, drivers and nearby infrastructure. Pan/zoom the satellite view like a normal map.</div>
        <div class="cell-strip" id="cellStrip"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-right">
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Risk score</h2>
        <div class="score-card">
          <div class="score-ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="none" stroke="#1B2721" stroke-width="10"/><circle id="scoreArc" cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="none" stroke="var(--risk-moderate)" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="264" stroke-dashoffset="264"/></svg><div class="center"><span class="num" id="scoreNum">—</span><span class="of100">/ 100</span></div></div>
          <div class="score-meta"><div class="cat" id="scoreCat">—</div><div class="prob" id="scoreProb">probability —</div><div class="loc" id="scoreLoc">no site selected</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Explainable AI</h2>
        <div class="explain-sentence" id="explainSentence">Select a hotspot on the map to see why the model rates it this way.</div>
        <div id="contribList"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Infrastructure exposure</h2>
        <div class="infra-summary" id="infraSummary">—</div>
        <ul class="infra-list" id="infraList"></ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Historical context</h2>
        <div class="hist-card"><div class="sim"><span class="pct" id="histPct">—</span><span class="label">similarity</span></div><div class="desc" id="histDesc">Select a site to compare current what-if conditions with a reference historical event.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h2>Emergency contacts</h2>
        <div id="emergencyContactsList"></div>
        <div class="map-hint" style="margin-top:8px;">Numbers marked <b>unverified</b> were the best on file at build time but not confirmed against an official source this session — call the department to confirm before relying on them.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel route-panel" id="alertPanel">
    <h2>Automated alerts &amp; notifications (simulated)</h2>
    <div class="sim-note" style="display:block; margin-bottom:12px;"><span class="dot"></span> No real SMS/push/email is sent from this standalone demo — this simulates what a connected backend (see <span class="mono">alertDispatchService.js</span>) would trigger whenever a site's score crosses <b>50/100</b>. Move the rainfall slider or switch sites to see it fire.</div>
    <div id="alertBannerSelected"></div>
    <div class="map-hint" style="margin:10px 0 6px;">Dispatch log (most recent first)</div>
    <div id="alertLogList"><div class="route-empty">No site has crossed the alert threshold yet in this session.</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel route-panel">
    <h2>Evacuation route support (real road network)</h2>
    <div class="route-controls">
      <button class="find-btn" id="findRouteBtn">Find safest route to nearest shelter</button>
      <span class="route-empty" id="routeHint">Uses the selected hotspot as the starting point.</span>
    </div>
    <div id="routeResults"><div class="route-empty">Select a hotspot on the map, then find a route.</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">
    Coordinates are approximate town/district centres, not verified official monitoring stations. Risk scores are probabilistic outputs of a simplified illustrative model (rainfall, slope, soil moisture, vegetation loss, historical proximity) and are not a certified operational forecast. Satellite imagery © Esri and its data providers; road routing © OSRM/OpenStreetMap contributors. In deployment, thresholds, alerts and evacuation guidance must be calibrated and validated against real satellite (NRSC/Bhuvan), IMD, Geological Survey of India and State Disaster Management Authority data before use.
  </div>
</div>

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.js"></script>
<script>
